.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBDetailHeader\fR: the head of a detail page (a playlist, an album, an artist), after the usual music\-app pattern.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBWide\fR: the cover on the left, a small kind label, the large title, the description and facts beside it, centered against the cover, and an action row under both: the main action first, then the options, then something at the far end.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBNarrow\fR (\fBnarrow\fR): the cover and the title centered, then the description and facts, and one action row with the options at the start and the main action at the end.
.IP \(bu 2
A wash of \fBtint\fR fades down from the top.
.PP
The application decides which arrangement from its width (for example \fBWidthClass::of(width) < WidthClass::Md\fR).
.PP
.nf
.RS
DetailHeader::new("Evening drive")
    .kind("Playlist")
    .cover(cover)
    .description(ty::body("Slow songs for a long road."))
    .facts(ty::caption("24 songs, 1 hr 32 min"))
    .primary(suggested_circular_button(Icon::Play.view(16.0)).on_press(Msg::Play))
    .action(menu_button(Icon::ViewMore, menu))
    .tint(cover_color)
    .narrow(width < 576.0)
.RE
.fi
